---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import '../styles/global.css'
import knightImage from '../assets/scaled_purple_knight.png'
const pageName = "home"
---

<Layout pageName={pageName}>
    
        <div class="textbox">

            <img id="logo" class="bsw" style="margin-bottom: 2em; " height="200px"  src={knightImage.src} alt="">
            <h2 id="welcome" style="z-index: -1; position: relative">Welcome to my website! </h2>           
            
            <p>
                Heyo <yellow>Isaac</yellow> here,
                <br>

                The main purpose of this place is to showcase my various interests and projects on the world wide web, and of course to share a little bit about myself, and potentially connect with others. 
            </p>
            <p>
                I am always working on adding new stuff to this site so make sure to check back once in a while.  
                This website was developed without the use of frameworks, essentially "hardcoded". 
                At some point i'll be doing a revamp of this site and use some kind of frontend framework to make my life easier, but for now I'll stick to 
                copy-pasting chunks of HTML instead of using components :').
            </p>
            <p>
                Make sure to visit all the pages before leaving, and if you have constructive criticism, feedback, questions, or just want to talk feel free to reach out to me. 
                <br>P.S. you can find my discord and instagram at the bottom of the page, and you can even email me at <a href="mailto:isaacbfeldman@gmail.com">isaacbfeldman@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>

